    * updated build
    * releasing
    * releasing
    * update: replace MAINTAINER with LABEL fix: change cache clearing directory
    * Merge pull request #526 from ShotaroMuraoka/fix/dockerfile-improvement
    * fix: to avoid scanning the current directory for composer.json
    * Merge pull request #528 from ShotaroMuraoka/fix/scanning-invalid-directories
    * Use phpacker for binary release
    * Merge pull request #530 from phpmetrics/binary-phpacker
    * updated documentation
    * Updated logo
    * releasing v2.8.2
    * fix trends not displayed correctly
    * fix wrong details link to oop page
    * Fix PHP 8.2+ deprecation about dynamic property
    * Merge pull request #536 from davidmpaz/deprecation-warnings-dynamic-property
    * Merge pull request #532 from zimmer-yan/fix/wrong-details-link-for-oop
    * Merge pull request #531 from zimmer-yan/fix/trends-not-displayed-correctly
    * Avoid depreciations with PHP >= 8.3
    * Merge pull request #538 from phpmetrics/fixes_ci_php83
    * [#533] Way to set the composer path
    * Merge pull request #539 from phpmetrics/composer_path
    * releasing v2.8.2
    * releasing v2.8.2
    * Automate releases and fix release packaging
    * Merge pull request #540 from phpmetrics/release_auto
    * Clarify that --exclude replaces the default exclusion list
    * Merge pull request #541 from phpmetrics/exclude_vendor_warning
    * fix: Removed warnings in HTML report generation from PHAR builds and fixes paths
    * Merge pull request #543 from phpmetrics/fix_phar_report
    * fix: Trying to fix the Github Workflow for tagging
    * Merge pull request #544 from phpmetrics/fix_release
    * Publish PhpMetrics on Homebrew via a dedicated tap
